@startuml
title Diagnostic Loop Pipeline Overview

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho

together {
package "Initial Flow" {
  component "InputNormalization" as InitialInputNormalization
  component "QueryStructuring" as InitialQueryStructuring
  component "InformationAdequacyInitial" as InitialInformationAdequacy
  component "CandidateCardRetrieval" as InitialCandidateCardRetrieval
  component "CardHydration" as InitialCardHydration
  component "IncidentEvidenceRetrieval" as InitialIncidentEvidenceRetrieval
  component "TheoryEvidenceRetrieval" as InitialTheoryEvidenceRetrieval
  component "PromptContextAssembly" as InitialPromptContextAssembly
  component "LlmStructuredGeneration" as InitialLlmStructuredGeneration
  component "ResponseValidationAndNormalization" as InitialResponseValidation
  component "WaitForUser" as InitialWaitForUser
  component "FinishWithResult" as InitialFinish
}

package "Continuation Flow" {
  component "InputNormalization" as ContinuationInputNormalization
  component "ObservationBoundaryResolver" as ContinuationObservationBoundaryResolver
  component "ObservationExtraction" as ContinuationObservationExtraction
  component "InformationAdequacySupportedObservation" as ContinuationAdequacySupported
  component "InformationAdequacyUnsupportedObservation" as ContinuationAdequacyUnsupported
  component "CandidateCardRetrieval" as ContinuationCandidateCardRetrieval
  component "CardBranchReranking" as ContinuationCardBranchReranking
  component "CardHydration" as ContinuationCardHydration
  component "IncidentEvidenceRetrieval" as ContinuationIncidentEvidenceRetrieval
  component "TheoryEvidenceRetrieval" as ContinuationTheoryEvidenceRetrieval
  component "DiagnosticUpdatePromptContextAssembly" as ContinuationPromptContextAssembly
  component "LlmStructuredGeneration" as ContinuationLlmStructuredGeneration
  component "ResponseValidationAndNormalization" as ContinuationResponseValidation
  component "WaitForUser" as ContinuationWaitForUser
  component "FinishWithResult" as ContinuationFinish
}
}

InitialInputNormalization -down-> InitialQueryStructuring
InitialQueryStructuring -down-> InitialInformationAdequacy
InitialInformationAdequacy -down-> InitialCandidateCardRetrieval : Sufficient
InitialInformationAdequacy --> InitialWaitForUser : Blocking or WeakButRunnable
InitialCandidateCardRetrieval -down-> InitialCardHydration
InitialCardHydration -down-> InitialIncidentEvidenceRetrieval
InitialIncidentEvidenceRetrieval -down-> InitialTheoryEvidenceRetrieval
InitialTheoryEvidenceRetrieval -down-> InitialPromptContextAssembly
InitialPromptContextAssembly -down-> InitialLlmStructuredGeneration
InitialLlmStructuredGeneration -down-> InitialResponseValidation
InitialResponseValidation -down-> InitialFinish

ContinuationInputNormalization -down-> ContinuationObservationBoundaryResolver
ContinuationObservationBoundaryResolver -down-> ContinuationObservationExtraction : Supported
ContinuationObservationBoundaryResolver --> ContinuationAdequacyUnsupported : Unsupported
ContinuationObservationExtraction -down-> ContinuationAdequacySupported
ContinuationAdequacySupported -down-> ContinuationCandidateCardRetrieval : Sufficient
ContinuationAdequacySupported --> ContinuationWaitForUser : Blocking or WeakButRunnable
ContinuationAdequacyUnsupported --> ContinuationWaitForUser
ContinuationCandidateCardRetrieval -down-> ContinuationCardBranchReranking
ContinuationCardBranchReranking -down-> ContinuationCardHydration
ContinuationCardHydration -down-> ContinuationIncidentEvidenceRetrieval
ContinuationIncidentEvidenceRetrieval -down-> ContinuationTheoryEvidenceRetrieval
ContinuationTheoryEvidenceRetrieval -down-> ContinuationPromptContextAssembly
ContinuationPromptContextAssembly -down-> ContinuationLlmStructuredGeneration
ContinuationLlmStructuredGeneration -down-> ContinuationResponseValidation
ContinuationResponseValidation -down-> ContinuationFinish

InitialInputNormalization -[hidden]right-> ContinuationInputNormalization
InitialInformationAdequacy -[hidden]right-> ContinuationObservationBoundaryResolver
InitialCandidateCardRetrieval -[hidden]right-> ContinuationAdequacySupported
InitialCardHydration -[hidden]right-> ContinuationCandidateCardRetrieval
InitialIncidentEvidenceRetrieval -[hidden]right-> ContinuationCardHydration
InitialTheoryEvidenceRetrieval -[hidden]right-> ContinuationIncidentEvidenceRetrieval
InitialPromptContextAssembly -[hidden]right-> ContinuationTheoryEvidenceRetrieval
InitialLlmStructuredGeneration -[hidden]right-> ContinuationPromptContextAssembly
InitialResponseValidation -[hidden]right-> ContinuationResponseValidation
InitialFinish -[hidden]right-> ContinuationFinish
ContinuationObservationExtraction -[hidden]right-> ContinuationAdequacyUnsupported
ContinuationCandidateCardRetrieval -[hidden]left-> ContinuationWaitForUser

note right of InitialInformationAdequacy
Initial flow uses a single adequacy gate.
If adequacy is not sufficient, the iteration waits for user input.
end note

note left of ContinuationObservationBoundaryResolver
Continuation flow branches first on observation support.
Only the supported branch executes observation extraction.
end note

note left of ContinuationAdequacyUnsupported
Unsupported observations always end in WaitForUser
for the current iteration.
end note

note right of InitialFinish
Any step may also terminate the current iteration
with FinishWithError after a recorded step error.
end note

@enduml
